Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","review_id":"yrFNIejIKGCmmUODe4FnKA","date":"2018-09-23T09:40:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9461680054664612,"text_excerpt":"Super fun night! I'm not really into karaoke, unless it's in my car...but at one point I think we had 30 of us on that stage! And I even danced across that stage!! I've never been to a karaoke bar like that before, i've only gone to places where you can rent a private room with a few friends and sing, so this was definitely an experience! Good music, the guy up there kept things moving, the words on the screen were big enough for me to see (lol!) and the bouncers did their job trying to get people to come in and keep the trouble out. I think i'll keep my day job, though, my singing is worse than i thought. Our group had the upstairs area and balcony overlooking Bourbon street, it was just..."},{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","review_id":"sdQPulkMHGFlRCvLpzVHZg","date":"2017-08-22T16:27:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445211291313171,"text_excerpt":"This place was hella fun! Karaoke was great to watch... I wouldn't dare participate. Well I would have but the heat kept taking my drunkness away so I wasn't drunk enough to muster up the courage to sing. But it was fun to watch. The host, she was funny. Had a balloon ball floating around to keep the audience engaged. Even pulled some guys up on stage to show their best sexy dance. It was hilarious. There's an outside smoking area with a bar with tv's so you can watch whoever's doing karaoke. I like how this place made everyone interact with one another."},{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","review_id":"l7N_KWqJ7Nm8IKoQ2KUCsQ","date":"2013-06-18T03:41:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9424648284912109,"text_excerpt":"I absolutely love to see people sing...wait, scratch that. I absolutely love seeing DRUNK people sing. The wigs, the songs, the acts, the dancing. TOO FUNNY. Karaoke bars are usually fun but this one had a great crowd, great hype man and host on stage, and non-stop entertainment. After a long, hot day of walking where my feet were throbbing and in pain, this was the highlight of my day! This is my favorite bar on Bourbon. :)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","photo_id":"di_Hc9J-FXFPt8hnrPzsyA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/di_Hc9J-FXFPt8hnrPzsyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9105532169342041},{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","photo_id":"Z-KqSf8zygugIFk5cyNvnA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Z-KqSf8zygugIFk5cyNvnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9039140343666077},{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","photo_id":"7GHDoM76qRjPzdZlw3kS1A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7GHDoM76qRjPzdZlw3kS1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.895348072052002},{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","photo_id":"E_wprjHg0xXaogZMDrUSyg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/E_wprjHg0xXaogZMDrUSyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8548482656478882},{"business_id":"0eP5RJNSsSYdPvUY3ZbTvw","photo_id":"zcxG-rT9exiGuifsosdqbg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/zcxG-rT9exiGuifsosdqbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8242758512496948}]},"notebook_case":null}
